ass=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.List.t</span> <a href=\"../Dune_stanza_scan/index.html#type-marker_contract\">Dune.marker_contract</a></span></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-issues\"><a href=\"#val-issues\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> issues : <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <a href=\"../Dune_stanza_scan/index.html#type-marker_contract\">Dune.marker_contract</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span>string <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base__List</span>.t</span></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-members\"><a href=\"#val-members\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> members : \u000A  <span><span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.List.t</span> <a href=\"../Dune_stanza_scan/index.html#type-marker_contract\">Dune.marker_contract</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span>(<span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.string * <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.Sexp.t * <span class=\"type-var\">'a</span>)</span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.List.t</span></span></code></div></div>"}